@startuml

[*] --> WaitingForConfig

WaitingForConfig --> CampaignInitialized : Load config\nSelect report path

CampaignInitialized --> PreparingBattle

PreparingBattle --> BattleRunning : Next battle exists
PreparingBattle --> CampaignFinished : No more battles

BattleRunning --> ExecutingRound : Timer tick

ExecutingRound --> RandomEvent : Event triggered
ExecutingRound --> UpdatingGUI : No event

RandomEvent --> UpdatingGUI

UpdatingGUI --> BattleRunning : Battle continues

UpdatingGUI --> BattleFinished : Army defeated

BattleFinished --> PreparingBattle : Next battle exists

BattleFinished --> CampaignFinished : Last battle

CampaignFinished --> [*]

@enduml